    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/c5d5e9d7ea41a25a8d47f4b8341815fa.avif?t=1749800144\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dimly lit garages of the 1960s to the cutting-edge digital studios of today, <i>Music Producer Tycoon</i> takes you on a journey through the evolution of music production. Write, record, and release your own tracks as you rise from underground obscurity to global fame. Craft hits that echo through stadiums, shape the sound of generations, and carve your name into the history of music.  <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/c271519b977ffae9950fb2d3bfbab71a.poster.avif?t=1749800144\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/c271519b977ffae9950fb2d3bfbab71a.webm?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/c271519b977ffae9950fb2d3bfbab71a.mp4?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Garage to Global Fame</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey in a dusty 1960s garage and rise through the decades. Evolve your sound, adapt to changing trends, and build your legacy as a legendary music producer in a living, breathing timeline from 1965 to today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/dbe9fa9169a73b501594b8c29f40876d.poster.avif?t=1749800144\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/dbe9fa9169a73b501594b8c29f40876d.webm?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/dbe9fa9169a73b501594b8c29f40876d.mp4?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring Your Songs to Life with AI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your lyrics come alive with a single click. With powerful AI support, you can generate vocals using in-game credits, customize the background, theme, and vocal style to match your artistic vision. Every track is uniquely yours and so are the emotions it delivers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/30016496240f254c62cdbf15f15ec3ff.poster.avif?t=1749800144\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/30016496240f254c62cdbf15f15ec3ff.webm?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/30016496240f254c62cdbf15f15ec3ff.mp4?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duets &amp; Star Management: Perform with Legends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay stocked with high quality produce, meats, and essentials. A well-managed inventory means happy customers and faster service!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/3a7814cce033f94b97f33517f9778198.poster.avif?t=1749800144\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/3a7814cce033f94b97f33517f9778198.webm?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/3a7814cce033f94b97f33517f9778198.mp4?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f\u00a0<strong> Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-powered song creation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music genre &amp; theme evolution based on real years (1965\u20132024)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content inspired by real-world genre trends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full songwriting, mixing, and publishing system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duet and artist management mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career path shaped by player choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG-style artist system: aging, rise &amp; fall, discovering new stars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themed studios and multiple music genres</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Music Producer Tycoon</strong> to your wishlist now and be among the first to play!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1749800144\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/c5d5e9d7ea41a25a8d47f4b8341815fa.avif?t=1749800144\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dimly lit garages of the 1960s to the cutting-edge digital studios of today, <i>Music Producer Tycoon</i> takes you on a journey through the evolution of music production. Write, record, and release your own tracks as you rise from underground obscurity to global fame. Craft hits that echo through stadiums, shape the sound of generations, and carve your name into the history of music.  <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/c271519b977ffae9950fb2d3bfbab71a.poster.avif?t=1749800144\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/c271519b977ffae9950fb2d3bfbab71a.webm?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/c271519b977ffae9950fb2d3bfbab71a.mp4?t=1749800144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Garage to Global Fame</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey in a dusty 1960s garage and rise through the decades. Evolve your sound, adapt to changing trends, and build your legacy as a legendary music producer in a living, breathing timeline from 1965 to today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656650/extras/dbe9fa9169a73b501594b8c29f40876d.poster.avif?t=1749800144\" width=616 height=250 ><source 